id:"contract_id",an_insights_csv_h_topic:"contract_topic",an_insights_csv_h_sphere:"sphere",an_insights_csv_h_insight_id:"insight_id",an_insights_csv_h_note:"note",manifest_btn:"🏛️ Atlas Manifesto",manifest_modal_title:"THE ATLAS MANIFESTO",manifest_modal_subtitle:"Founding Code of the Internal Contract & Personal Discipline",manifest_preamble_t:"Preamble",manifest_preamble_b:"Any external contract is worth precisely as much as a person’s word carries before themselves. This document establishes the rules of an honest agreement between my intent and my action—without any right to self-deception, distorting reality, or rewriting the past.",manifest_priorities_t:"Fundamental Priorities",manifest_priority_1:"Discipline over motivation.",manifest_priority_2:"Firmness of one’s word over mood.",manifest_priority_3:"The fact of action over excuses.",manifest_pillar1_t:"01. Irreversibility of Recorded Time",manifest_pillar1_b:"The past cannot be edited retroactively. Full execution, partial execution, or breach of a commitment is sealed at the moment permanently. The history of actions forms an unbroken chronological ledger that cannot be falsified to flatter one’s ego.",manifest_pillar2_t:"02. Inviolability of the Founding Agreement",manifest_pillar2_b:'The terms of an agreement made with oneself remain unchanged. Whenever circumstances or strategy require revising the rules, this occurs not through silent breach, but through an official Supplementary Agreement on a "Before — After" basis recording the reason for change.',manifest_pillar3_t:"03. Radical Honesty Over Guilt",manifest_pillar3_b:"Breaching an agreement is neither hidden behind self-soothing nor punished with emotional self-flagellation. A failure is an event that halts progress until a sober, cold root-cause analysis is conducted and a conclusion is recorded.",manifest_pillar4_t:"04. Full Sovereignty of the Subject",manifest_pillar4_b:"This system uses no manipulation, artificial rewards, or external evaluation. All agreements, execution protocols, and analytics belong exclusively to the author of the agreement and remain under their sole control.",manifest_acceptance_t:"Acceptance",manifest_acceptance_b:"By creating my first contract in the Atlas system, I affirm my readiness to be honest with myself even when the required action contradicts an immediate desire.",manifest_close_btn:"Accept Code & Close",help_btn:"📚 Atlas User Guide",help_modal_title:"Atlas User Guide (v3.0)",help_modal_subtitle:"Canonical handbook: immutability rules, E2EE security, 4 UI views, L0–L2 levels & Offline-First",help_expand_all:"Expand all",help_collapse_all:"Collapse all",help_close_btn:"Got it, close",help_sec1_t:"🏛️ 1. Philosophy & Discipline of Atlas",help_sec1_b:`• Zero Time-Travel (Immutable Past): rewriting or backdating past days for cosmetic charts is strictly forbidden. Every log is cryptographically sealed once recorded—for instance, if you missed Wednesday, it remains an honest baseline in history.
• 21-Day Experiments & Fundamental Agreements: every new discipline starts best with a 21-day proving cycle to test daily feasibility in real life. Upon completion, promote the contract to Fundamental status for long-term stability.
• Supplementary Agreements (Amendment): future rule changes never overwrite history—instead, they are issued as formal Amendments with a transparent "Before ➔ After" comparison protocol.`,help_sec2_t:"🛡️ 2. Data Sovereignty & Security (E2EE)",help_sec2_b:`• Your Personal Google Drive: all agreements, logs, and insights live exclusively in your own cloud storage (restricted drive.file scope, Project_Atlas_DB folder)—with zero third-party servers or subscriptions.
• Zero-Knowledge Encryption: data is encrypted directly on your device using AES-GCM-256 before leaving for the cloud. Even Google sees only scrambled ciphertext.
• PIN & 12-Word BIP-39 Seed: your PIN enables fast daily access on this device, while your 12-word BIP-39 mnemonic phrase is the master emergency key to restore all data on any device.`,help_sec3_t:"📱 3. 4 Core App Views",help_sec3_b:`• Dashboard: your daily command center for marking contract execution, tracking active streaks and 21-day Experiment progress, and capturing daily insights.
• Dashboard & Analytics: 4 canonical KPI counters (Total Agreements, Agreement Types, Discipline Spheres, System Discipline), the vector AnalyticsSvgChart with target baselines for Physical L2 contracts, reflections timeline, Markdown (.md) and CSV (.csv) exports, and printable A4 Contract Act generation.
• New Agreement: guided 4-step contract wizard—from choosing sphere, verification level, and Manifest to sealing the immutable GENESIS_HASH fingerprint.
• Settings & Security: System Health Check telemetry console, NTP clock check, Merkle chain repair, PIN & 12-word BIP-39 management, UA / EN / DE language selector, and Backup Self-Test.`,help_sec4_t:"⏰ 4. Cinderella Engine & Verification Levels",help_sec4_b:`• Business-Day Shift (Cinderella Engine): late-night entries (up to 04:00 AM, e.g., logged at 1:30 AM) credit the previous business day fairly, preserving your unbroken streaks.
• Verification Levels (L0–L2): L0 Declarative (simple factual mark with no quota); L1 PIN-Protected (guards against accidental or impulsive taps); L2 Quantitative—Strict mode (fixed Sets × Reps, e.g. 3×20) and Hybrid mode (daily total volume in any split, e.g. 40+40+20 = 100).
• Friction Lock: after a skip or breach, the system requires a meaningful 50+ character root-cause reflection verified by Shannon entropy ≥ 3.0—blocking lazy filler like "123123" or "aaaaa".`,help_sec5_t:"🚀 5. Offline Mode, Sync & Backups",help_sec5_b:`• Offline-First & CRDT Deltas: the app runs seamlessly without internet on local IndexedDB (AtlasOfflineDB v4) and pushes compact atlas_deltas.json patches to Google Drive as soon as connectivity returns.
• Backup Self-Test: safely verify any emergency .json backup inside Settings & Security strictly in memory (Read-Only) using your PIN or 12 words—with zero risk to your live database.`,an_insights_filter_contract:"Filter by agreement",an_insights_filter_all_contracts:"All Agreements",an_insights_filter_sphere:"Filter by sphere",an_insights_filter_all_spheres:"All Spheres",an_insights_filter_mental:"🧠 Mental",an_insights_filter_physical:"💪 Physical",an_insights_filter_reset:"Reset export filters",set_archive_threshold_title:"Active Bundle Size Threshold Exceeded (> 200 KB)",set_archive_threshold_desc:"atlas_database.json exceeds the 200 KB fast-startup target. Offload oldest logs to atlas_archive.json while keeping all KPIs, streaks, and insights intact.",set_archive_compact_btn:"Optimize (< 200 KB)",set_archive_compact_done_toast:"Optimized! Moved to atlas_archive.json logs:",dash_archive_banner_cta:"Archive Now",hc_title:"System Health Check Console",hc_subtitle:"Monitor bundle footprint, WebKit storage persistence, NTP time drift, and Merkle Tree integrity",hc_run_btn:"Run Health Check",hc_running:"Checking...",hc_last_checked:"Last check:",hc_bundle_label:"Gross Bundle Size (atlas_database.json)",hc_bundle_ok:"Healthy (< 200 KB)",hc_bundle_over:"Threshold exceeded (> 200 KB)",hc_storage_label:"WebKit Storage Persistence (Storage API)",hc_storage_persisted:"PROTECTED (Persisted)",hc_storage_volatile:"VOLATILE (Not Persisted)",hc_storage_unsupported:"API Unavailable",hc_storage_request_btn:"Request Persistence",hc_storage_persisted_toast:"Browser granted persistent storage protection.",hc_storage_volatile_toast:"Browser kept storage volatile (typical outside A2HS or in private mode).",hc_ntp_label:"NTP Time Offset (networkTimeOffset)",hc_ntp_normal:"SYNCED",hc_ntp_drift:"TIME SHIFT ANOMALY",hc_ntp_sync_btn:"🔄 Probe NTP",hc_ntp_syncing:"Probing NTP...",hc_ntp_synced_toast:"NTP offset updated:",hc_ntp_tz_label:"Timezone:",hc_ntp_source_label:"Source:",hc_ntp_offline_